{"title":"Ash Charm","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Ashsworn Acolyte, Ashsworn Pyromancer, Ashsworn Flamekeeper, The Ash Prophet</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ash-prophet\" title=\"The Ash Prophet - dropped it in 1 of 1 looted corpses (1/1)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/35d700aeda6bf8e97e88.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">The Ash Prophet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ashsworn-acolyte\" title=\"Ashsworn Acolyte - dropped it in 9 of 13 looted corpses (1/1.4)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/02255d14ff8bd6cf9790.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ashsworn Acolyte</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.4<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ashsworn-pyromancer\" title=\"Ashsworn Pyromancer - dropped it in 2 of 3 looted corpses (1/1.5)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/caa8240e09557824956a.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ashsworn Pyromancer</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.5<br>×1–2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"ashsworn-flamekeeper\" title=\"Ashsworn Flamekeeper - dropped it in 1 of 4 looted corpses (1/4)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/29175ddcade6e6db3652.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ashsworn Flamekeeper</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how man